DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260813T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260813T193000
SUMMARY:Patriarchy\, Matriarchy & Democracy: A Two-Part Online Discussion
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nThis is an LFS online discussio
 n series\, held on Zoom\, in 2 parts.\n**I will add the 2 Zoom links here\
 , next Thursday. [2 links will be here]**\nZoom restricts a Basic account 
 to 40 minute sessions. I'll provide 2 links so we can keep going after the
  time limit.\n\nAcross two sessions\, we’ll explore how patriarchy and m
 atriarchy organize power\, care\, law\, family\, sex\, money\, violence\, 
 and democracy.\n\nWe’ll use consciousness-raising style discussion rules
 : speak personally\, listen carefully\, don’t interrupt\, and don’t de
 bate someone while they are speaking.\n\nFor each question\, we’ll do a 
 speaking round first. After everyone who wants to speak has done so\, Susa
 n will offer brief evidence\, examples\, or definitions to deepen the disc
 ussion.\n\n**Part 2 August 13**\n\n* What are the benefits of each?\n* Wha
 t are the dangers or pitfalls of each?\n* Can an equalitarian democracy ex
 ist inside a patriarchy?\n\nThis is not a lecture. It is a structured conv
 ersation about power\, equality\, family\, sex\, law\, care\, violence\, d
 emocracy\, and what kind of world we want to build.\n\n**About Susan’s E
 vents**\nEvents I organize welcome open inquiry and diverse viewpoints wit
 hin a foundation of equality\, human dignity\, and democracy.\nRacist\, se
 xist\, fascist\, anti-LGBTQ\, or other ideologies that deny anyone’s equ
 al rights are not welcome or open for debate. Participants are never requi
 red to defend or debate their humanity or equality.\nI may interrupt or re
 move anyone whose words or conduct violate these boundaries.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/
 315783028/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260722T004859Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260722T004859Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
