SUMMARY:Evening Discussion and Dinner!
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nEnjoy dinner and discussion at 
 Indian Curry Lounge with us\, 6:00pm\, Saturday August 22nd!\n\nYou may re
 member this Indian restaurant location was previously known as Namaste\, a
 nd before that Tulsi. It is built into the first floor of the motel buildi
 ng\, it is two doors down from El Serranos\, where we meet for our other m
 onthly evening meeting!\n\nIndian Curry Lounge\n2101 Columbia Avenue\nLanc
 aster PA 17603
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/
 315779916/
