SUMMARY:Placeholder August Movie Night!  NOT CONFIRMED\, FINALIZED
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nX\n-Trailer-\n\nX\n-Trailer-\n\
 nX\n-Trailer-\n\nX\n-Trailer-\n\nX\n-Trailer-\n\nAnd many\, many more! Bri
 ng your own film selections and we may decide to show them!\n\nAdmission i
 s Free! Bring as many family members and friends as you would like! Please
  RSVP! Discussion after the movie(s)\, hang out and share your thoughts!\n
 \nSome drinks and snacks will be provided\, please do bring more to share!
 \nPizza will be ordered\, please do chip in if you partake in delivered fo
 od!\n\nSaturday\, August 29th\, 6:00pm - 10:00pm\nOther Room Theater\n715 
 N. Pine St.\nLancaster PA 17603\n\nWe can delay starting the movie to give
  people time to arrive\, but no later than 6:30pm\, please try to arrive b
 efore then if you do not want to miss any of the movie.\n\nPICTURED below 
 is the main entrance\, the event space is right up the stairs. On street p
 arking should be available\, several public parking lots such as behind CV
 S are within a 2 blocks walk along Harrisburg Pike.
